<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two S.Korean firms buy 21,500 tonnes U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Two S.Korean firms buy 21,500 tonnes U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Cheiljedang Corp and Dongah Flour Mills Co Ltd on Thursday bought a total of 21,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat from Japanese trading house Marubeni Corp, traders said.</p>
</text>
